"en_raw": "Was there a temple"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "9c3009d1",
"en_raw": "in a place like this...?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "015d6945",
"en_raw": "Um...?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a8bfac0c",
"en_raw": "...I tell the origin of the Seven Gods"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "cbe06b09",
"en_raw": "The pair who opened Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "7b4af59e",
"en_raw": "the woman became a black bird"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "4581e88c",
"en_raw": "the man became a fierce waterfall"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "00e88053",
"en_raw": "Thus Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "3b1574b4",
"en_raw": "became the village of the seven gods..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "bf8f3f89",
"en_raw": "A black bird... a crow...?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "e7e82c0a",
"en_raw": "...Muddy thoughts form sediment"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "de3813e7",
